<MainLayout title="Men’s Recovery Housing"><PageHero eyebrow="Men’s housing" title="A structured place to keep moving forward." intro="Recovery residences for adult men in Pittsburgh-area communities, with peer support and accountability built into daily life." image="/images/mens-community.jpg" imageAlt="Two men having a conversation in a community setting" />
<section class="section"><div class="container grid-2"><div><p class="eyebrow">Men’s residences</p><h2>Room to rebuild routines and stability.</h2></div><div><p class="lead">Our men’s homes are designed for adults committed to living substance-free and participating in a recovery-focused community.</p><p>New Beginnings has men’s residences in Sheraden, McKees Rocks, and other Pittsburgh-area communities. Exact locations are shared privately during intake.</p><ul class="rule-list"><li><strong>Peer-supported environment</strong>Live alongside other men doing the daily work of recovery.</li><li><strong>Clear expectations</strong>Shared standards help protect the stability of the whole house.</li><li><strong>Connection to services</strong>Residents remain connected to independent treatment and recovery resources.</li></ul></div></div></section><InquiryForm title="Ask about men’s housing" /></MainLayout>
